    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103775" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τήθυον</span></b> , τό, an animal
		of the kind called <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ascidia</i> or <i>sea-squirt</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				531a18
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τηθέου</span>
			), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PA</u>
				680a5
			</span></i>, al.; once in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τηθεα διφῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.747
				</span></i>
			 (= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶδος θαλασσίων
			ὀστρέων</span>, Sch.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				304
			</span></i>. (For the variation <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τήθυον</span>:
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τήθεον</span>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτύον</span>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτέον</span>, etc.; <i>tethea</i> is pl. in <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				32.117
			</span></i>, nom. sg. fem. ib.<i><span class="en">
				151
			</span></i>.) </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τηθύα: τενάγη, ἂ προχέουσιν οἱ
			ποταμοί</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
